        "hint": "Use path plus exactly one of id or documentPath. MCP first authorizes that document tree and verifies that the image is directly referenced there, then returns metadata followed by one standard MCP image content block. Only PNG, JPEG, WebP, and GIF up to 20 MiB are accepted. It never writes a host file or runs OCR.",
        "parameters": {
