          "Flashcard removal only removes riff card bindings from a deck. It does not delete the underlying note blocks; deleting note blocks is a separate block/document delete workflow.",
          "flashcard(action="remove_card") requires explicit user confirmation before execution.",
        ],
        "hint": "Use scope="all" | "deck" | "notebook" | "tree" plus filter="due" | "new" | "old". For scope="all", omit deckID; an empty string is treated as omitted. For scope="deck", pass a non-empty deckID. For scope="notebook", pass notebook. For scope="tree", pass rootID. reviewedCards is optional and follows SiYuan's review flow.",
        "parameters": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "List due flashcards and optionally filter to new/old cards.",
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "const": "list_cards",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "deckID": {
              "description": "Deck ID, required when scope=deck. For scope="all", omit deckID; an empty string is treated as omitted.",
              "type": "string",
            },
            "filter": {
              "description": "Filter returned cards: "due", "new", or "old"",
