              "description": "Human-readable workspace path. Prefer including the notebook name (e.g., /Notebook or /Notebook/Folder) for unambiguous resolution; a notebook-omitted path is accepted only when it uniquely matches across readable notebooks. Use / to list all readable notebooks.",
              "type": "string",
